Cell["\<\
The distance to a set is the least distance to one of its points: the shell \
about two vertices is the outer layer of the union of the two balls, and does \
not contain the vertices.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5e7b0284-bdeb-466f-b5d6-c189ca077711"],

